// Cross-service query — the reason this project exists.
//
// Given only a TfL stop id, Orbital:
//   1. calls TfL StopPoint to resolve the stop's Latitude / Longitude
//   2. feeds those coordinates into Police.uk to fetch street crime
//
// Orbital is never told TfL and Police.uk are connected. It discovers the path
// because both APIs are mapped onto the same uk.gov taxonomy.
//
// 940GZZLUOXC = Oxford Circus Underground Station.
given { stop : uk.gov.TransportStopId = "940GZZLUOXC" }
find { uk.gov.apis.police_uk.StreetCrime[] }
